  "toolingQualifications": [
    "The first final verification invocation preceded the driver status observation because an overlong PTY record line filled the input buffer. It failed before API checks; its raw failure log is retained. Ctrl+U then the short status command yielded the actual observation; unchanged verifier then passed12 assertions.",
    "An initial360 theme audit sampled media changes before settling. The retained settled audit explicitly checks expected versus actual theme for all6 cases and supersedes that initial sampling.",
    "The originally executed driver bytes are retained exactly. Only the reusable driver notification annotation/verification changed after owner authorization; no executing runtime was hotpatched. Standalone observed verifier checks actual notices by run+text and performs concurrent exact accepted API retries.",
